      "Name": "AIUsageByModel",
      "CategoryID": "@lookup:MJ: Query Categories.Name=AI",
      "UserQuestion": "What is the efficiency, cost, token distribution, and latency for each AI model and vendor?",
      "Description": "Per vendor and model (and currency): model-call count, priced/unpriced run counts, own cost, prompt/completion tokens, median and 95th-percentile latency, and cache efficiency percentage.",
      "SQL": "@file:SQL/ai-usage-by-model.sql",
      "TechnicalDescription": "Aggregates vwAIUsageFacts by VendorID, ModelID and CostCurrency over model calls only (parallel parents excluded). Optional start/end filter the base RunAt column. OwnCost sums priced runs only, with PricedRuns/UnpricedRuns beside it. LatencyP50/P95 are PERCENTILE_CONT window functions collapsed with MAX (SQL Server 2019+). CacheEfficiencyPct = TokensCacheRead * 100 / (TokensPrompt + TokensCacheRead), with both addends COALESCEd.",
      "Status": "Approved",
